														<r3d:remarks>eEnsemblfungi uses NCBI taxonomy. Since 2009, the EnsemblGenomes  site has been complemented by the creation of five new sites, for bacteria, protists, fungi, plants and invertebrate metazoa, enabling users to use a single collection of (interactive and programatic) interfaces for accessing and comparing genome-scale data from species of scientific interest from across the taxonomy. See also: e!ensembl</r3d:remarks>
